Dark fumes erupt from the ground in radius [3, 3, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] for 5 turns. Any creature entering the circle will receive either a bane of confusion or a bane of blindness.

Only one bane can affect a creature.

Banes last for [4, 5, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] turns, and also deal [35, 47, 56, 64, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
